Cara singing the song in the accompanying music video awards three awards at the 2003 MTV Video Music Awards. The director of the video, Jake Nava, received the Music Video Production Association award for Best R&B Video in 2004. " Crazy in Love " has been a staple of Beyoncé 's live shows and concert tours since 2003. American Society of Composers, Authors and Publishers (ASCAP) named " Crazy in Love " one of the most performed tracks of 2004. Artists such as David Byrne have recorded their own versions of the song, and it has been used in a number of television programmes and other media.

