This track, " You Only Live Twice " (1992) was sampled by Acen for his track " Trip II the Moon Part 2 ". Icelandic singer Björk released a cover version in 1997. Robbie Williams used the song's unique string figure in " Millennium " but chose to re-record it due to cost considerations. Coldplay performed the song during their 2001 tour, and Natacha Atlas covered it for her 2005 compilation album The Best of Natacha Atlas. Shirley Bassey, who has three original Bond themes, has also recorded the song.

